  "explanation": "The == (loose) guard coerces the numeric string '8' to the number 8, so the cell whose value is the string '8' also matches the target 8. The result includes beta as well as alpha, printing 'alpha beta' instead of just 'alpha'.",
  "prompt": "This collects the labels of every cell whose value matches the target. Step through and predict which labels print.",
